    "奶油色小熊玩偶\n第18–20圈：每圈36短针（36）\n第21圈：(5短针, 1减针) ×6（30）\n第22圈：每针1短针（30）\n放入安全眼，间隔6针\n第23圈：(4短针, 1减针) ×6（24）\n第24圈：(3短针, 1减针) ×6（18）\n开始塞棉花，边钩边塞\n第25圈：(2短针, 1减针) ×6（12）\n第26圈：6减针（6）\n第38圈：收针藏线（6）": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "奶油色小熊玩偶\n第18–20圈：每圈36短针（36）\n第21圈：(5短针, 1减针) ×6（30）\n第22圈：每针1短针（30）\n放入安全眼，间隔6针\n第23圈：(4短针, 1减针) ×6（24）\n第24圈：(3短针, 1减针) ×6（18）\n开始塞棉花，边钩边塞\n第25圈：(2短针, 1减针) ×6（12）\n第26圈：6减针（6）\n第38圈：收针藏线（6）"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cream teddy bear\nRnd 18–20: sc around (36)\nRnd 21: (5 sc, dec) ×6 (30)\nRnd 22: sc around (30)\nInsert safety eyes 6 stitches apart\nRnd 23: (4 sc, dec) ×6 (24)\nRnd 24: (3 sc, dec) ×6 (18)\nStart stuffing as you crochet\nRnd 25: (2 sc, dec) ×6 (12)\nRnd 26: dec ×6 (6)\nRnd 38: Fasten off and weave in ends (6)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "奶油色小熊玩偶\n第18–20圈：每圈36短針（36）\n第21圈：(5短針, 1減針) ×6（30）\n第22圈：每針1短針（30）\n放入安全眼，間隔6針\n第23圈：(4短針, 1減針) ×6（24）\n第24圈：(3短針, 1減針) ×6（18）\n開始塞棉花，邊鉤邊塞\n第25圈：(2短針, 1減針) ×6（12）\n第26圈：6減針（6）\n第38圈：收針藏線（6）"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "クリーム色のテディベア\n18〜20段：細編みで1周（36）\n21段：（細編み5、2目一度）×6（30）\n22段：細編みで1周（30）\n6目離して安全目を付ける\n23段：（細編み4、2目一度）×6（24）\n24段：（細編み3、2目一度）×6（18）\n編みながら綿を詰め始める\n25段：（細編み2、2目一度）×6（12）\n26段：2目一度×6（6）\n38段：糸を切って糸始末（6）"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "크림색 곰돌이\n18–20단: 짧은뜨기 한 바퀴 (36)\n21단: (짧은뜨기 5, 모아뜨기) ×6 (30)\n22단: 짧은뜨기 한 바퀴 (30)\n안전 눈을 6코 간격으로 달기\n23단: (짧은뜨기 4, 모아뜨기) ×6 (24)\n24단: (짧은뜨기 3, 모아뜨기) ×6 (18)\n뜨면서 솜 넣기 시작\n25단: (짧은뜨기 2, 모아뜨기) ×6 (12)\n26단: 모아뜨기 ×6 (6)\n38단: 마무리하고 실 끝 정리 (6)"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cremefarbener Teddy\nRd 18–20: fM rundum (36)\nRd 21: (5 fM, 2 fM zus) ×6 (30)\nRd 22: fM rundum (30)\nSicherheitsaugen mit 6 M Abstand einsetzen\nRd 23: (4 fM, 2 fM zus) ×6 (24)\nRd 24: (3 fM, 2 fM zus) ×6 (18)\nBeim Häkeln mit dem Ausstopfen beginnen\nRd 25: (2 fM, 2 fM zus) ×6 (12)\nRd 26: 2 fM zus ×6 (6)\nRd 38: Faden abschneiden und vernähen (6)"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Osito color crema\nV 18–20: pb alrededor (36)\nV 21: (5 pb, dism) ×6 (30)\nV 22: pb alrededor (30)\nColoca los ojos de seguridad a 6 puntos\nV 23: (4 pb, dism) ×6 (24)\nV 24: (3 pb, dism) ×6 (18)\nEmpieza a rellenar mientras tejes\nV 25: (2 pb, dism) ×6 (12)\nV 26: dism ×6 (6)\nV 38: Cierra y esconde las hebras (6)"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ourson crème\nT 18–20 : ms tout autour (36)\nT 21 : (5 ms, 1 dim) ×6 (30)\nT 22 : ms tout autour (30)\nPlace les yeux de sécurité à 6 mailles d’écart\nT 23 : (4 ms, 1 dim) ×6 (24)\nT 24 : (3 ms, 1 dim) ×6 (18)\nCommence à rembourrer en crochetant\nT 25 : (2 ms, 1 dim) ×6 (12)\nT 26 : dim ×6 (6)\nT 38 : Arrête et rentre les fils (6)"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ursinho creme\nV 18–20: pb em toda a volta (36)\nV 21: (5 pb, dim) ×6 (30)\nV 22: pb em toda a volta (30)\nColoque os olhos de segurança a 6 pontos de distância\nV 23: (4 pb, dim) ×6 (24)\nV 24: (3 pb, dim) ×6 (18)\nComece a encher enquanto faz o crochê\nV 25: (2 pb, dim) ×6 (12)\nV 26: dim ×6 (6)\nV 38: Arremate e esconda as pontas (6)"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orsetto crema\nG 18–20: mb tutto intorno (36)\nG 21: (5 mb, dim) ×6 (30)\nG 22: mb tutto intorno (30)\nInserisci gli occhi di sicurezza a 6 punti di distanza\nG 23: (4 mb, dim) ×6 (24)\nG 24: (3 mb, dim) ×6 (18)\nInizia a imbottire mentre lavori\nG 25: (2 mb, dim) ×6 (12)\nG 26: dim ×6 (6)\nG 38: Chiudi e nascondi i fili (6)"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crèmekleurige beer\nT 18–20: v rondom (36)\nT 21: (5 v, mind) ×6 (30)\nT 22: v rondom (30)\nZet de veiligheidsoogjes 6 steken uit elkaar\nT 23: (4 v, mind) ×6 (24)\nT 24: (3 v, mind) ×6 (18)\nBegin met vullen terwijl je werkt\nT 25: (2 v, mind) ×6 (12)\nT 26: mind ×6 (6)\nT 38: Afhechten en draden wegwerken (6)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
